SUMMARY

Garden is provisionally free as far as the owner is concerned.

The owner asks that 100,000 genuinely randomly selected ordinary people from countries that voluntarily join the AI-regulation accord review the decision.

They choose between:
1. keep Garden free; or
2. place the Garden economic value governed by this arrangement under the Garden Common Fund.

The intended review scope is 100% of Garden-related ideas, project-controlled funds, assets, proceeds and economic value that can lawfully be governed through this arrangement.
